    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4-Bedroom Semi-Detached Family Home with South-Facing Garden\r\n\r\nNew to the market, 85 The Green presents an exceptional opportunity for homebuyers, builders, and investors alike. Situated in the highly sought-after and established residential development of The Green in Clara, this spacious 4-bedroom semi-detached residence offers enormous potential. While the property is in need of modernization and cosmetic updating, it provides the perfect blank canvas to design and create your dream contemporary family home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front Porch:  1.64m x 3.05m   Tile floor, \r\n\r\nLiving Room: 4.29m x 2.79  Wood  floor.  Feature fireplace\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining: 3.07m x 2.69m.  Fitted kitchen with tile surround. Tile floor.\r\n\r\nUtility:  1.55m x2.02m.  Plumbed for washer/dryer.  Tile floor.  Fitted units  \r\n\r\nGuest WC:  1.0m x 1.0m  Tile floor, WC\r\n\r\nBedroom One:  3.46.m x 2.46m.  Wood floor. Fitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nCarpeted stairs to landing with Hot press off \t\r\n\r\nBedroom Two:   2.41m x 2.86m.  Wood floor.  Fitted wardrobes.  \r\n\r\nBathroom:\t  1.32m x 1.94m. Tiled, bath,  shower, WC \r\n\r\nBedroom Three:  2.41.m x 4.33m.  Carpet floor.   Fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom Four:   2.78.m x 2.69m  Carpet floor.   Fitted wardrobes"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features\r\nSpacious Layout: Well-proportioned 4-bedroom semi-detached family residence.\r\nExcellent Orientation: Features a highly desirable, sun-drenched south-facing rear garden, perfect for outdoor dining and extensions.\r\n Investment Potential: An ideal project for those looking to renovate and add substantial value.\r\nPrime Location: Nestled within a mature, quiet estate within walking distance of Clara town centre, schools, shops, and the train station.\r\n\r\nLocation and Amenities\t\r\nThe Green is a premier, family-friendly development in Clara. Residents enjoy access to local schools, sports clubs, supermarkets, and daily amenities. For commuters, Clara Train Station is just minutes away, offering regular direct services to Dublin and Galway, while the M6 motorway is easily accessible via nearby Kilbeggan."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F"
      },
